 Severity and Priority

Bug 1: App crashes when a wrong OTP is entered on the login screen
Severity: Critical 
Priority: High

Bug 2: Continue button is enabled when mobile number field is empty
Severity: Minor 
Priority: Normal

Bug 3: App accepts 9-digit mobile number on login screen
Severity: Major 
Priority: High

Bug 4: Resend OTP link stays disabled after timer ends
Severity: Major 
Priority: Normal

Bug 5: App name spelling mistake on login screen header
Severity: Trivial 
Priority: High

Bug 5, where severity and priority are different :

The spelling mistake does not break any functionality, so the severity is Trivial. 
But the app name is the brand identity on the first screen every user sees. 
A wrong spelling looks unprofessional and can make users doubt that the app is genuine, which matters a lot for a payments app. 
It is also a very quick fix, so the priority is High.
